  11: 'Every formed environment and proof node with finite functional discharges, graph_node_inputs_at, and targets at existing environment positions admits a fresh native node extension preserving every old artifact and binding.',
  12: 'Every specialization_binding_at E pu pr d c F v r G w t report bs Is Ks is preserved when only E is included in a formed larger environment.',
  13: 'inference_specialization_on_sources: the complete native reader argument is equivalent to the same node, binding record, report, discharges and support enumerations in the presented environments.',
  14: 'environment_value_presents_total: every formed environment has a complete presentation.',
  15: 'clause_specialization_reading_inhabited: an actual specialization exists, as recovered by clause_specialization_reading_exact.',
  16: 'An explicit finite source witness and all complete native reader premise judgments have been executed and independently checked.',
  40: 'Every actual clause specialization admits an environment extension with its exact complete inference_specialization_at reading, preserving the original environment and both unchanged record and target sources.',
